                                    documents and other records submitted,
                                    uploaded or attached with this
                                    application are genuine, valid and
                                    lawfully belong to me / my business,
                                    as applicable.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    Where a copy or scanned copy is
                                    submitted, I confirm that it is a true
                                    and accurate copy of the original
                                    document and has not been forged,
                                    altered or misrepresented.
                                </p>
                                <p class="mb-0">
                                    I understand that if any information
                                    or document is found to be false,
                                    forged, altered or misleading, the
                                    Association may reject my application
                                    or take appropriate action regarding
                                    my membership in accordance with
                                    its rules.
                                </p>

                                <div class="form-check mt-4">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="authenticityAgreement" name="AuthenticityAgreement" required>
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="authenticityAgreement">
                                        I confirm the authenticity of the information and documents submitted. <span class="required">*</span>
                                    </label>
